<title>CANADA: Dylex's main holder to sell 20 pct stake.</title>
<headline>Dylex's main holder to sell 20 pct stake.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Dylex Ltd's main holder, composed of River Road Canada and Silverton International Fund, said on Friday it agreed to sell 9.974 million shares to a syndicate led by CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p>The sale, under a bought deal basis, leaves River Road and Silverton with a stake of about 20 percent after it unloads about 20 percent. The two are under the umbrella of Greenwich, Conn.-based Paloma Partners.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close about August 14.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
